  "instructions": [
    "Season veal slices with salt, pepper, and mustard powder.",
    "Coat each slice lightly with flour.",
    "Heat olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat until shimmering.",
    "Add veal slices and sear for 2 minutes per side, then remove and set aside.",
    "In the same skillet, add stock, plant-based milk, soy sauce, thyme, and red pepper flakes; bring to a simmer.",
    "Stir in shredded vegan cheese until melted and the sauce thickens into a glassy-jelly consistency.",
    "Return veal to the skillet and flambé with a splash of brandy, letting the flame subside.",
    "Serve hot on toasted rye bread or a crisp side, garnished with extra thyme."
